sequenceDiagram
  title Production URL to relevant fresh context
  participant RSS
  participant Acquisition
  participant Reader
  participant Publisher
  participant Postgres
  participant Classifier
  participant NativeD1
  participant CharacterPlugins
  RSS->>Acquisition: URL and query subjects
  Acquisition->>Reader: Resolved publisher URL
  Reader->>Publisher: Sandboxed public browser request
  Publisher-->>Reader: Rendered page
  Reader-->>Acquisition: Headline and article body
  Acquisition->>Postgres: Retain body and provenance
  Classifier->>Postgres: Load body and subject records
  Postgres-->>Classifier: Article and canonical identity
  Classifier->>NativeD1: Article plus meta per subject
  NativeD1-->>Classifier: Subject emotion availability movement
  Classifier->>Postgres: Receipt and gated obligations
  CharacterPlugins->>Postgres: Load eligible fresh sources
  Postgres-->>CharacterPlugins: Same retained reader body
